        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you rise to the top of the real estate market?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Housing Market</strong>, you’ll step into the fast-paced world of property buying, selling, and client matching. Every deal matters. Find the right home for the right client and become a rich agent. <strong>Housing Market</strong> is a simplified Multiple Listing Service (MLS) sim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Estate Agent by Day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every real estate agent needs clients to buy properties. Match clients to their next property and get a commission percentage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/cd1f91a8ec187285ceba7efe60a90252.poster.avif?t=1773467507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/cd1f91a8ec187285ceba7efe60a90252.webm?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/cd1f91a8ec187285ceba7efe60a90252.mp4?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Estate Investor by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your income to invest in properties and upgrade or rent them out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/b0bd0ca989cd9630dd0fdfbfba29a974.poster.avif?t=1773467507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/b0bd0ca989cd9630dd0fdfbfba29a974.webm?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/b0bd0ca989cd9630dd0fdfbfba29a974.mp4?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade the MLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to improve your real estate game. Larger commissions = more money. More clients = more money. More listings = more money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finished Product</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Housing Market</strong> is designed as a complete experience from day one. While we don’t plan regular updates, we’ll always fix any major issues and may add more content if players ask or if inspiration strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re looking for a relaxing management sim or a numbers-focused strategy challenge, Housing Market offers a clean, web-style interface inspired by modern MLS systems, streamlined mechanics, and a minimalist design that’s easy to pick up — all built around a single-sitting experience, with average play sessions lasting about <strong>40–60 minutes</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you rise to the top of the real estate market?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Housing Market</strong>, you’ll step into the fast-paced world of property buying, selling, and client matching. Every deal matters. Find the right home for the right client and become a rich agent. <strong>Housing Market</strong> is a simplified Multiple Listing Service (MLS) sim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Estate Agent by Day</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every real estate agent needs clients to buy properties. Match clients to their next property and get a commission percentage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/cd1f91a8ec187285ceba7efe60a90252.poster.avif?t=1773467507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/cd1f91a8ec187285ceba7efe60a90252.webm?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/cd1f91a8ec187285ceba7efe60a90252.mp4?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Estate Investor by Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your income to invest in properties and upgrade or rent them out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/b0bd0ca989cd9630dd0fdfbfba29a974.poster.avif?t=1773467507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/b0bd0ca989cd9630dd0fdfbfba29a974.webm?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068560/extras/b0bd0ca989cd9630dd0fdfbfba29a974.mp4?t=1773467507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade the MLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to improve your real estate game. Larger commissions = more money. More clients = more money. More listings = more money.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finished Product</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Housing Market</strong> is designed as a complete experience from day one. While we don’t plan regular updates, we’ll always fix any major issues and may add more content if players ask or if inspiration strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re looking for a relaxing management sim or a numbers-focused strategy challenge, Housing Market offers a clean, web-style interface inspired by modern MLS systems, streamlined mechanics, and a minimalist design that’s easy to pick up — all built around a single-sitting experience, with average play sessions lasting about <strong>40–60 minutes</strong>.</p>",
